         "answer_latex": "k'(2) = 24",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Fundamental Theorem with the chain rule for the upper limit x^2.",
               "latex": "k'(x) = f\\left(x^{2}\\right) \\cdot 2x"
