      {
         "id": "d",
         "prompt": "Let \\( w(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{2x + 1} f(t)\\,dt \\). Find \\( w'(x) \\), the value of \\( w'(1) \\), and the value of \\( w''(1) \\).",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "w'(x) = 2f(2x + 1), \\quad w'(1) = 6, \\quad w''(1) = 8",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Fundamental Theorem with the chain rule for the upper limit 2x + 1.",
               "latex": "w'(x) = 2f(2x + 1)"
